# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is ignored and never committed. One key per service and network,
# each raising that pair from the public tier — about one request a second — to ten. Obtain them
# from https://t.me/tonapibot (toncenter) and https://tonconsole.com (tonapi).
#
# Every key is read in one place, `sting_chain::ApiKeys`, and reaches one place, the request
# header. A key without a value here is not an error: the run is slower, not different.
TONCENTER_API_KEY_MAINNET=
TONCENTER_API_KEY_TESTNET=
TONAPI_API_KEY_MAINNET=
TONAPI_API_KEY_TESTNET=
